# Patch backups. Note: not a blanket `*.orig` -- the repo deliberately tracks
# some (e.g. experiments/bench_results/gemv_inject_backup/__init__.py.orig), and
# a broad glob would silently swallow future ones.
#
# These two specifically are the ad-hoc instrumentation of **upstream vLLM**: a
# pristine copy of core.py and the patch diffed against it. They are kept out of
# the repository on purpose -- the submission should not carry changes to
# upstream vLLM, and this instrumentation only ever existed in site-packages on
# this machine. Both remain on disk under /root/src so the local environment can
# be reverted. Findings.md still describes the method; only the artefact is out.
experiments/src/_vllm_orig/
experiments/src/vllm_stage_prof.patch
